WEBVTT

00:04:59.434 --> 00:05:01.860
And I was organizing
with a bunch of activists --

00:05:01.884 --> 00:05:03.059
of course --

00:05:03.083 --> 00:05:06.621
and we were thinking that probably
we needed to expand our circle

00:05:06.645 --> 00:05:07.801
a little bit,

00:05:07.825 --> 00:05:11.216
that we weren't going to successfully
stop the war if, you know --

00:05:11.240 --> 00:05:12.406
just amongst us.

00:05:12.430 --> 00:05:14.010
So we decided we'd build bridges,

00:05:14.034 --> 00:05:15.600
expand our circle,

00:05:15.624 --> 00:05:18.987
and so the great, anarchist
versus communist soccer tournament

00:05:19.011 --> 00:05:21.052
of 2001 was born.

00:05:21.076 --> 00:05:22.076
(Laughter)

00:05:22.188 --> 00:05:23.395
That's it.

00:05:23.419 --> 00:05:26.265
That's how large my circle
was allowed to expand.

00:05:27.045 --> 00:05:29.015
Building bridges with liberal Democrats?

00:05:29.039 --> 00:05:31.436
Oh, no way, that was a bridge too far.